{
  "longTitle": "A Bill to make provision for disqualification from membership of the House of Commons and the House of Lords on grounds relating to residence and domicile for taxation purposes; and for connected purposes",
  "summary": "<p>This Bill would introduce a new disqualification procedure for members of both Houses relating to residence and domicile for tax purposes. It would require Members and peers to submit a declaration that they complied with these conditions to the Speaker or the Lord Speaker.</p>",
